          "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\">Healthcare teamwork and communication</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The most efficient, productive, and safe teams accomplish great outcomes because they have great communication and teamwork. This section provides courses to educate on the topic of teamwork and communication, as well as quality improvement strategies and best practices for improving quality.</span></p>\n",
