          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Teamwork and Communication<br>\n</h2>\n<h3>Learning objectives</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Define communication and the importance in the O.R.</li>\n<li>Define the types of communication failures that occur in the O.R.</li>\n<li>Describe the effects of communication failures in the O.R.</li>\n<li>List the properties of effective team communication</li>\n<li>Define factors that impact communication in the O.R.</li>\n<li>Describe the role that High Reliability Organizations play in creating a Just Culture</li>\n<li>List techniques that can be used to improve team communication in the O.R.</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 22 2022 20:43:55 GMT+0000",
